+    </section>
+    <section anchor="error-codes" numbered="false" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-unnumbered-4">
+      <name slugifiedName="name-error-codes">ERROR CODES</name>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-unnumbered-4-1">All error codes defined in the file Transfer Protocol could be
+returned.</t>
+    </section>
+    <section anchor="printer-control-codes" numbered="false" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-unnumbered-5">
+      <name slugifiedName="name-printer-control-codes">PRINTER CONTROL CODES</name>
+      <table align="center" pn="section-unnumbered-5-1">
+        <thead>
+          <tr>
+            <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Hex</th>
+            <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Octal</th>
+            <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1"/>
+          </tr>
+        </thead>
+        <tbody>
+          <tr>
+            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">D1</td>
+            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">321</td>
+            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Meaning: Set line width to 72 characters</td>
+          </tr>
+          <tr>
+            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">D2</td>
+            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">322</td>
+            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Meaning: Use the full width of your printer</td>
+          </tr>
+          <tr>
+            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">03</td>
+            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">323</td>
+            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Meaning: Set page size to 66 line</td>
+          </tr>
+          <tr>
+            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">04</td>
+            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">324</td>
+            <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Meaning: Set page size to infinite</td>
+          </tr>
+        </tbody>
+      </table>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-unnumbered-5-2">Other virtual printer control codes can be added in the future.</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-unnumbered-5-3">Other classes of control codes can be added as the need arises.</t>
